OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers are likely in the
OL,6,Fnorth and west during the morning,
OL,7,Fotherwise most areas look set to have
OL,8,Fa dry day with sunny spells. A brisk
OL,9,Fnorthwesterly wind will ease, and
OL,10,Ffeeling pleasant enough in the
OL,11,Fsunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe evening will start fine
OL,14,Fwith some sunshine, and clear spells
OL,15,Fare likely overnight. However, cloud
OL,16,Fwill increase from the west, with
OL,17,Fpatchy rain starting to arrive by the
OL,18,Fmorning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
