OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FEarly sunshine is likely in
OL,6,Fthe east on Thursday. However, cloud
OL,7,Fand patchy rain will spread from the
OL,8,Fwest, heralding an increasingly wet
OL,9,Fand breezy afternoon. Heavier rain
OL,10,Farriving later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBrighter
OL,13,Fweather returns on Friday, with
OL,14,Fsunshine and occasional light showers.
OL,15,FA spell of wind and rain is likely
OL,16,Flater on Saturday, ahead of brighter
OL,17,Fskies with showers on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
